@startuml sd22_closures_switches
!include ../style.iuml
title SD-22 Send closures and switch commands (UC-22)
autonumber

box "CTC Office process" #F7F9FC
participant "StubCtcOffice" as Model
end box
participant "Central Harness" as H
participant "Track Controller\n(the line's)" as TC

Model -> Model : closed_blocks = closed + closing blocks,\nthe full set, sorted
Model -> Model : switch_commands = every commanded switch\n(none outside maintenance mode)
Model -> Model : keep only the lines that are ready (SD-24)
Model --> H : outputs.track_controller:\nclosed_blocks, switch_commands
H -> H : ctc_to_track_controller(line):\nthe line's blocks and switches
H -> TC : (tick k+1) closed blocks; switch commands\n(normal / reverse, by switch block)
TC -> TC : a listed block may not be overridden;\nthe PLC program moves a commanded switch
TC --> H : (later tick) the switch reports its new position
H --> Model : switches input (SD-17): Set switch position\nshows "Reported by track controller"
@enduml
